+## [v0.1.30-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R43 — opt-in navigation notification card candidate.
+
+### English
+- Display real ongoing navigation notifications from a restricted map-app allowlist in existing letterbox space, only after explicit opt-in.
+- Clear on disable, disconnect or removal; no route inference, storage, logging or new network requests.
+- Preserve source recovery indicators and original video geometry; independent map routing remains unavailable.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 用户单独开启后，在原导航留白区显示受限地图应用的持续导航通知真实文字。
+- 关闭、断开或通知撤销时清除，不推断路线、不持久化、不写日志或新增联网请求。
+- 保留源恢复提示和原视频几何，尚不具备独立地图路线引擎。
+
